OL,3,APolls close in New Zealand election
OL,4,Awith results expected to be tight
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolls have now closed in New Zealand,
OL,7,Fwhere Prime Minister Christopher Luxon
OL,8,Fand his National-led coalition are
OL,9,Fseeking a second term
OL,11,FHis main challenger is Chris Hipkins,
OL,12,Fleader of the centre-left Labour party
OL,14,FResults will begin to come in over the
OL,15,Fcoming hours but will not be official
OL,16,Ftill later this month
OL,18,FThe country's voting system, known as
OL,19,FMixed Member Proportional, also means
OL,20,Fmost governments are coalitions
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
